@␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀"¬␀@␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀rs485_init␀␀app_main␀␀␀␀␀␀Ђ?␀$tЙ␀$tIoѓ:НММ=␀␀aE␀␀А@8	@T8	@h8	@x8	@Њ8	@¤8	@ё8	@М8	@д8	@ш8	@9	@ 9	@89	@P9	@h9	@€9	@њ9	@ґ9	@М9	@д9	@␀:	@:	@(:	@<:	@P:	@h:	@Ђ:	@њ:	@apply_static_ip␀app_eth_init␀␀␀␀d␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀яяяяd␀␀␀ ␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀app_mqtt_start␀␀app_mqtt_init␀␀␀app_config_factory_reset␀␀␀␀app_config_init␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀h_config_json␀␀␀app_web_start␀␀␀¬1	@␀␀␀@␀␀␀␀аY	@␀␀␀І@␀␀␀␀рY	@␀␀␀€@␀␀␀␀шY	@␀␀␀@␀␀␀␀Z	@␀␀␀Ъ@␀␀␀␀Z	@␀␀␀t@␀␀␀␀ Z	@␀␀␀0@␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀яяя␀␀P␀␀Ђ␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="de">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>JK-BMS Bridge вЂ“ Konfiguration</title>
<style>
  body { font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; margin: 16px auto; max-width: 760px; padding: 0 12px; color: #1c2733; }
  h1 { font-size: 1.35rem; }
  fieldset { border: 1px solid #c5ccd4; border-radius: 6px; margin: 14px 0; }
  legend { font-weight: 600; padding: 0 6px; }
  label { display: block; margin: 8px 0; }
  input[type=text], input[type=password] { padding: 6px; width: 300px; max-width: 100%;
    border: 1px solid #9aa4ad; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 0.95rem; }
  .hint { color: #5b6670; font-size: 0.85rem; margin: 4px 0; }
  button { padding: 8px 18px; font-size: 1rem; border-radius: 6px; border: 1px solid #2f6fb0;
    background: #3b78b8; color: #fff; cursor: pointer; margin-right: 8px; }
  .off { display: none; }
  .ok { color: #187a2f; font-weight: 600; }
  .err { color: #b3261e; font-weight: 600; }
  code { background: #eef1f4; padding: 1px 5px; border-radius: 4px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>JK-BMS Bridge вЂ“ Konfiguration</h1>
<p id="meta">ladeвЂ¦</p>

<form id="f">
  <fieldset>
    <legend>Web-OberflГ¤che</legend>
    <label>Neues Web-Passwort (leer = unverГ¤ndert)
      <input type="password" name="pw" autocomplete="new-password">
    </label>
    <label><input type="checkbox" name="pw_clear"> Vorhandenes Web-Passwort entfernen</label>
    <p class="hint">Ohne Passwort ist die WeboberflГ¤che im Netzwerk frei zugГ¤nglich.</p>
  </fieldset>

  <fieldset>
    <legend>Netzwerk (Ethernet)</legend>
    <label><input type="checkbox" id="dhcp" name="dhcp"> IP-Adresse per DHCP beziehen</label>
    <div id="staticfields">
      <label>IP-Adresse <input type="text" name="ip" maxlength="15" placeholder="192.168.1.50"></label>
      <label>Netzmaske <input type="text" name="mask" maxlength="15" placeholder="255.255.255.0"></label>
      <label>Gateway <input type="text" name="gw" maxlength="15" placeholder="192.168.1.1"></label>
      <label>DNS-Server <input type="text" name="dns" maxlength="15" placeholder="192.168.1.1"></label>
    </div>
    <p class="hint off" id="dnshint">Im DHCP-Modus dient dieser DNS-Server als zusГ¤tzlicher Fallback,
      falls der DHCP-Server keinen (brauchbaren) DNS-Lieferant ist.</p>
  </fieldset>

  <fieldset>
    <legend>MQTT</legend>
    <label>Broker-URI (mqtt://host:port)
      <input type="text" name="uri" maxlength="120" placeholder="mqtt://192.168.1.10:1883">
    </label>
    <label>Benutzername <input type="text" name="user" maxlength="63" autocomplete="off"></label>
    <label>MQTT-Passwort (leer = unverГ¤ndert)
      <input type="password" name="pass" autocomplete="new-password">
    </label>
    <label><input type="checkbox" name="pass_clear"> Vorhandenes MQTT-Passwort entfernen</label>
    <label><input type="checkbox" name="tls"> TLS verwenden (mqtts, eingebettetes CA-Zertifikat)</label>
    <p class="hint">Leere Broker-URI schaltet MQTT komplett aus (nur WeboberflГ¤che bleibt aktiv).</p>
  </fieldset>

  <fieldset>
    <legend>Diagnose</legend>
    <label><input type="checkbox" name="dbg"> RS485-Debug (Hexdump der Rohdaten im Log)</label>
  </fieldset>

  <p><button type="submit">Speichern (GerГ¤t startet danach neu)</button>
     <span id="msg"></span></p>
</form>

<fieldset>
  <legend>Firmware-Update</legend>
  <p>Installierte Software: <code id="ver">вЂ“</code> aus Partition <code id="part">вЂ“</code></p>
  <p>Standard-Update-URL (Build-Zeit): <code id="ourl">вЂ“</code></p>
  <label>Manuelle Update-URL (leer = Standard-URL verwenden)
    <input type="text" id="otaurl" name="ota_url" maxlength="255" placeholder="https://example.org/jkbms_mqtt_poe_p4.bin" autocomplete="off">
  </label>
  <p><button type="button" id="ourl_reset">Manuelle URL zurГјcksetzen</button>
     <span class="hint">Leere manuelle URL = der Update-Button nutzt wieder die Standard-URL
       und der Update-Check fragt eine вЂћversionвЂњ-Datei daneben ab.</span></p>
  <p>Update-Check: <code id="updinfo" class="status">noch nicht geprГјft</code>
     <button type="button" id="cbtn" style="margin-left:8px">Jetzt prГјfen</button></p>
  <p><button type="button" id="obtn">Update von der aktiven URL installieren</button>
     <span id="omsg"></span></p>
  <p class="hint">Aktiv ist die manuelle URL, sonst die Standard-URL. Die PrГјfung lГ¤dt nur eine
     kleine вЂћversionвЂњ-Textdatei (regelmГ¤Гџig sowie per вЂћJetzt prГјfenвЂњ) und zeigt hier und Гјber
     MQTT (<code>&lt;prefix&gt;/device</code>) an, ob eine neuere Version verfГјgbar ist. Die neue
     Firmware bootet zunГ¤chst вЂћpending verifyвЂњ und wird erst nach dem ersten fehlerfreien
     BMS-Poll bestГ¤tigt; bootet sie nicht, rollt der Bootloader automatisch zurГјck.
     MQTT-Trigger (<code>&lt;prefix&gt;/ota</code>) funktionieren unabhГ¤ngig davon mit beliebigen URLs.</p>
  <p>Status: <code id="ostat" class="status">idle</code></p>
  <p id="cmsg"></p>
</fieldset>

<script>
"use strict";
const $ = (id) => document.getElementById(id);
const f = document.forms.f;
const IPV4 = /^(\d{1,3}\.){3}\d{1,3}$/;
let cfg = null;

function show(id, cls, text) { const el = $(id); el.className = cls; el.textContent = text; }

function upd() {
  const dhcp = f.elements.dhcp.checked;
  $("staticfields").className = dhcp ? "off" : "";
  $("dnshint").className = dhcp ? "hint" : "hint off";
}

/* Text/class for the "Update-Check" line based on a version-state object
 * (from /config.json or /ota/version). */
function updInfoText(v) {
  if (v.checking) return "PrГјfung lГ¤uftвЂ¦";
  if (!v.checked) return "noch nicht geprГјft";
  if (v.available) return "UPDATE VERFГњGBAR: " + v.remote + " (installiert: " + v.installed + ")";
  return "aktuell" + (v.remote ? " (remote: " + v.remote + ")" : "");
}
function applyUpdInfo(v) {
  const t = updInfoText(v);
  if (v.checked && v.available) show("updinfo", "err", t);
  else if (v.checked) show("updinfo", "ok", t);
  else show("updinfo", "", t);
}

f.elements.dhcp.addEventListener("change", upd);
f.elements.pw.addEventListener("input", () => {
  if (f.elements.pw.value) f.elements.pw_clear.checked = false;
});
f.elements.pass.addEventListener("input", () => {
  if (f.elements.pass.value) f.elements.pass_clear.checked = false;
});

f.addEventListener("submit", async (ev) => {
  ev.preventDefault();
  const q = new URLSearchParams();
  if (!f.elements.dhcp.checked) {
    const v4 = ["ip", "mask", "gw", "dns"].map((n) => f.elements[n].value.trim());
    if (v4.some((v) => !IPV4.test(v))) {
      show("msg", "err", "Statisch: alle vier Adressen im Format a.b.c.d angeben.");
      return;
    }
  }
  if (f.elements.pw_clear.checked) q.set("pw_clear", "on");
  if (f.elements.pw.value.trim()) q.set("pw", f.elements.pw.value.trim());
  ["ip", "mask", "gw", "dns", "uri", "user"].forEach((n) => q.set(n, f.elements[n].value.trim()));
  q.set("ota_url", $("otaurl").value.trim());
  if (f.elements.pass.value.trim()) q.set("pass", f.elements.pass.value.trim());
  if (f.elements.pass_clear.checked) q.set("pass_clear", "on");
  q.set("dhcp", f.elements.dhcp.checked ? "on" : "0");
  q.set("tls", f.elements.tls.checked ? "on" : "0");
  q.set("dbg", f.elements.dbg.checked ? "on" : "0");

  try {
    const r = await fetch("/save", { method: "POST", body: q });
    show("msg", r.ok ? "ok" : "err", await r.text());
  } catch (e) {
    show("msg", "err", "Anfrage fehlgeschlagen.");
  }
});

$("ourl_reset").addEventListener("click", () => {
  $("otaurl").value = "";
  show("cmsg", "ok", "Manuelle URL geleert - speichern, um zur Standard-URL zurГјckzukehren.");
});

document.getElementById("cbtn").addEventListener("click", async () => {
  const cbtn = document.getElementById("cbtn");
  cbtn.disabled = true;
  try {
    const r = await fetch("/ota/check", { method: "POST" });
    show("cmsg", r.ok ? "ok" : "err", await r.text());
    if (!r.ok) { cbtn.disabled = false; return; }
  } catch (e) {
    show("cmsg", "err", "Anfrage fehlgeschlagen.");
    cbtn.disabled = false;
    return;
  }
  show("cmsg", "ok", "PrГјfung lГ¤uft (dauert ein paar Sekunden)вЂ¦");
  /* Poll until the check completed (max ~45 s), then show the result. */
  for (let i = 0; i < 45; i++) {
    await new Promise((res) => setTimeout(res, 1000));
    try {
      const r = await fetch("/ota/version");
      if (!r.ok) throw new Error(r.status);
      const v = await r.json();
      applyUpdInfo(v);
      if (!v.checking) break;
    } catch (e) {
      /* device may reboot during the check */
    }
  }
  show("cmsg", "", "");
  cbtn.disabled = false;
});

$("obtn").addEventListener("click", async () => {
  if (!confirm("Firmware von der aktiven URL laden, installieren und neu starten?")) return;
  $("obtn").disabled = true;
  try {
    const r = await fetch("/ota/install", { method: "POST" });
    show("omsg", r.ok ? "ok" : "err", await r.text());
  } catch (e) {
    show("omsg", "err", "Anfrage fehlgeschlagen.");
  }
});

async function load() {
  try {
    const r = await fetch("/config.json");
    if (!r.ok) throw new Error(r.status);
    cfg = await r.json();
    f.elements.dhcp.checked = cfg.dhcp;
    f.elements.ip.value = cfg.ip;   f.elements.mask.value = cfg.mask;
    f.elements.gw.value = cfg.gw;   f.elements.dns.value = cfg.dns;
    f.elements.uri.value = cfg.uri; f.elements.user.value = cfg.user;
    f.elements.tls.checked = cfg.tls;
    f.elements.dbg.checked = cfg.dbg;
    $("otaurl").value = cfg.ota_url || "";
    $("ver").textContent = cfg.app_version;
    $("part").textContent = cfg.partition;
    $("ourl").textContent = cfg.ota_default_url ? cfg.ota_default_url : "(nicht gesetzt)";
    $("ostat").textContent = cfg.ota_status || "idle";
    applyUpdInfo({
      checked: cfg.sw_update_checked, available: cfg.sw_update_available,
      checking: cfg.checking, remote: cfg.sw_update_version || "",
      installed: cfg.app_version || ""
    });
    $("meta").textContent = "Device-ID: jkbms-" + cfg.device_id +
      (cfg.pw_set ? " вЂ” Web-Passwort aktiv" : " вЂ” Web-OberflГ¤che ohne Passwort");
    upd();
  } catch (e) {
    $("meta").textContent = "Konfiguration konnte nicht geladen werden.";
  }
}

load();
setInterval(() => {
  fetch("/ota/status").then((r) => r.ok ? r.text() : Promise.reject())
    .then((t) => { $("ostat").textContent = t || "idle"; })
    .catch(() => { /* device may be rebooting */ });
}, 2000);
</script>
</body>
</html>
